  "about": {
    "title": "About",
    "description": [
      "I am a second-year PhD student in Computer Science at the National University of Singapore, fortunate to be advised by <a href=\"https://bohanwang123.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bohan Wang</a>. My work is in computer graphics, with a focus on 3D shape design and generation.",
      "I like building systems that are both mathematically clean and actually useful. My recent interests span graphics, geometric modeling, and generative methods for controllable 3D content. Before NUS, I completed my bachelor's degree in Computer Science at the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign."
    ],
